{
  "slug": "cleanercat",
  "name": "Cleanercat",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Mac disk cleanup and maintenance skills powered by CleanerCat. Scan junk, find large files, detect duplicates, and free up disk space.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `mac-clean-junk` (Use this skill when the user wants to clean up Mac junk files, clear caches, remove temporary files,…), `mac-disk-check` (Use this skill when the user wants to check Mac disk space, see how much storage is used…), `mac-find-duplicates` (Use this skill when the user wants to find duplicate files on their Mac, remove duplicate photos or…), `mac-find-large-files` (Use this skill when the user wants to find large files on their Mac, identify what is taking…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `cleanercat`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cleanercat@claude-community` from `wukongsheld/cleanercat-mac`.",
